{"id":"21d03b11a1381fa674680da4e209d300ad0d8009","url":"https://chenxiachan.github.io/thoughtdag","title":"ThoughtDAG — Make LLM context visible and editable","site_name":"TechURLs","source":"Hacker News","byline":null,"excerpt":"A local-first, open-source canvas where the graph determines what the model sees.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div aria-label=\"ThoughtDAG interactive story\" id=\"story\">\n        <div id=\"story-intro\">\n            <p>ThoughtDAG</p>\n            <h2 data-zh-html=\"思考值得一张地图<br /><span>连线即上下文</span>\" data-en-html=\"Your thinking deserves a map<br /><span>A wire is the context</span>\">\n              Your thinking deserves a map<br><span>A wire is the context</span>\n            </h2>\n            <p data-en=\"Scroll\" data-zh=\"向下滚动\">Scroll</p>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"world\">\n          <p>\n            CHAT HIDES CONTEXT.\n          </p>\n          <p>\n            THE GRAPH IS THE CONTEXT.\n          </p>\n\n          <p><span data-en=\"Linear conversation\" data-zh=\"线性聊天\">Linear conversation</span>\n          </p>\n          <p><span data-en=\"Editable context graph\" data-zh=\"可编辑的上下文图\">Editable context graph</span>\n          </p>\n          <p><span data-en=\"Same prompt · different context\" data-zh=\"同一个问题 · 不同的上下文\">Same prompt · different context</span>\n          </p>\n\n          \n\n          \n\n          <article data-start=\"0.00\">\n            <p><span data-en=\"AI conversation\" data-zh=\"AI 对话\">AI conversation</span>\n              <span data-en=\"87 messages\" data-zh=\"87 条消息\">87 messages</span>\n            </p>\n            <div>\n              <p>\n                Compare three research paths.\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                Start with the first. Its advantage is…\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                What if the core hypothesis fails?\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                Consider another explanation…\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                Also, what should I eat tonight?\n              </p>\n              <p>\n                There is a new restaurant nearby.\n              </p>\n              <p data-en=\"The history is here. Which parts enter the next request?\" data-zh=\"聊天都在这里，可下一次到底会带上哪些内容？\">\n                The history is here. Which parts enter the next request?\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article id=\"source-pdf\" data-start=\"0.15\" data-end=\"0.39\">\n            <p><span>research-paper.pdf</span><span>p.7</span>\n            </p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"Results\" data-zh=\"实验结果\">Results</h3>\n              \n              <p>\n                The effect appears only in the experimental condition.\n              </p>\n              <p><span data-en=\"Selected from the page\" data-zh=\"从原文中选中\">Selected from the page</span>\n            </p></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article id=\"evidence-a\" data-start=\"0.23\">\n            <p><span data-en=\"Clipped passage\" data-zh=\"摘出的段落\">Clipped passage</span><span>research-paper.pdf · p.7</span>\n            </p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"The effect appears only in the experimental condition\" data-zh=\"这个效应只在实验条件下出现\">\n                The effect appears only in the experimental condition\n              </h3>\n              <p><span data-en=\"Source linked · not wired yet\" data-zh=\"保留出处 · 尚未连入\">Source linked · not wired yet</span>\n            </p></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article id=\"research-question\" data-start=\"0.26\">\n            <p><span data-en=\"Asked from source\" data-zh=\"从原文追问\">Asked from source</span><span>research-paper.pdf · p.7</span>\n            </p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"What does this evidence actually mean?\" data-zh=\"这段证据究竟意味着什么？\">\n                What does this evidence actually mean?\n              </h3>\n              <p><span data-en=\"The source is in context\" data-zh=\"原文已进入上下文\">The source is in context</span>\n            </p></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article id=\"dinner-detour\" data-start=\"0.24\" data-end=\"0.61\">\n            <p><span data-en=\"Unrelated branch\" data-zh=\"无关分支\">Unrelated branch</span><span data-en=\"detour\" data-zh=\"岔路\">detour</span>\n            </p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"What should I eat tonight?\" data-zh=\"今晚吃什么？\">\n                What should I eat tonight?\n              </h3>\n              <p data-en=\"This history should not enter the research summary.\" data-zh=\"这段对话不该进入研究总结。\">\n                This history should not enter the research summary.\n              </p>\n              <p><span data-en=\"Still connected\" data-zh=\"仍在上下文中\">Still connected</span>\n            </p></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article id=\"polluted-summary\" data-start=\"0.30\" data-end=\"0.61\">\n            <p><span data-en=\"Polluted summary\" data-zh=\"混入闲聊的总结\">Polluted summary</span>\n              <span data-en=\"3 sources\" data-zh=\"3 个来源\">3 sources</span>\n            </p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"Research summary… also, consider hot pot for dinner.\" data-zh=\"研究总结……另外，晚饭可以吃火锅。\">\n                Research summary… also, consider hot pot for dinner.\n              </h3>\n              <p data-en=\"The prompt stayed the same. Polluted context changed the answer.\" data-zh=\"问题没变，混进来的上下文却改变了答案。\">\n                The prompt stayed the same. Polluted context changed the answer.\n              </p>\n              <p><span data-en=\"Includes unrelated branch\" data-zh=\"混入无关分支\">Includes unrelated branch</span>\n            </p></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article data-start=\"0.39\">\n            <p><span data-en=\"Will send\" data-zh=\"将发送给模型\">Will send</span><span>1,284 tokens</span>\n            </p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"Preview what the model will receive\" data-zh=\"生成前，先看看模型会读到什么\">\n                Preview what the model will receive\n              </h3>\n              <p data-en=\"Incoming ancestors:\" data-zh=\"这次会带上：\">\n                Incoming ancestors:\n              </p>\n              <p><span data-en=\"Research question\" data-zh=\"研究问题\">Research question</span>\n              <span data-en=\"Evidence A\" data-zh=\"证据 A\">Evidence A</span>\n              <span data-en=\"Dinner detour\" data-zh=\"晚饭话题\">Dinner detour</span></p><p data-en=\"After deleting the orange edge: −47 tokens\" data-zh=\"删掉橙色连线后：减少 47 tokens\">\n                After deleting the orange edge: −47 tokens\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article id=\"context-diff\" data-start=\"0.61\">\n            <p><span data-en=\"Context diff\" data-zh=\"上下文变化\">Context diff</span><span>−47 tok</span>\n            </p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"The dinner detour left context\" data-zh=\"晚饭话题已移出上下文\">\n                The dinner detour left context\n              </h3>\n              <p><span data-en=\"Same prompt · regenerate\" data-zh=\"同一个问题 · 再生成一次\">Same prompt · regenerate</span>\n            </p></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article id=\"same-prompt\" data-start=\"0.67\">\n            <p><span data-en=\"Same prompt\" data-zh=\"同一个问题\">Same prompt</span><span data-en=\"ask again\" data-zh=\"再问一次\">ask again</span>\n            </p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"Give me a bullet-point summary\" data-zh=\"请用要点总结\">\n                Give me a bullet-point summary\n              </h3>\n              <p data-en=\"The words are identical. Only one edge changed.\" data-zh=\"问题一字未改，只有一条连线变了。\">\n                The words are identical. Only one edge changed.\n              </p>\n              <p><span data-en=\"Reproducible context\" data-zh=\"上下文可复现\">Reproducible context</span>\n            </p></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article id=\"clean-answer\" data-start=\"0.75\">\n            <p><span data-en=\"Clean answer\" data-zh=\"更新后的回答\">Clean answer</span>\n              <span data-en=\"2 sources\" data-zh=\"2 个来源\">2 sources</span>\n            </p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"One: record the database version. Two: use independent reviewers. Three: resolve conflicts with a third reviewer.\" data-zh=\"要点一：记录数据库版本。要点二：双人独立筛选。要点三：冲突由第三人仲裁。\">\n                One: record the database version. Two: use independent reviewers. Three:\n                resolve conflicts with a third reviewer.\n              </h3>\n              <p data-en=\"The unrelated dinner suggestion is gone.\" data-zh=\"回答里不再出现无关的晚饭建议。\">\n                The unrelated dinner suggestion is gone.\n              </p>\n              <p><span data-en=\"Answer updated in place\" data-zh=\"答案已更新\">Answer updated in place</span>\n            </p></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article data-start=\"0.84\">\n            <p><span data-en=\"One rule\" data-zh=\"一条规则\">One rule</span><span>ThoughtDAG</span>\n            </p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"Wires are context.\" data-zh=\"连线即上下文\">\n                Wires are context.\n              </h3>\n              <p data-en=\"No hidden memory selector. What the model sees, why, and what was removed stay visible in the graph.\" data-zh=\"不必把上下文筛选交给藏在系统里的黑盒。模型看到了什么、为什么会看到、哪些内容被删掉，图上都清清楚楚。\">\n                No hidden memory selector. What the model sees, why, and what was removed\n                stay visible in the graph.\n              </p>\n              <p><span data-en=\"Visible\" data-zh=\"可见\">Visible</span>\n              <span data-en=\"Editable\" data-zh=\"可编辑\">Editable</span>\n              <span data-en=\"Inspectable\" data-zh=\"可追溯\">Inspectable</span>\n            </p></div>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n\n        \n\n        <div data-range=\"0.05 0.18\">\n            <p><small data-en=\"01 · The problem\" data-zh=\"01 · 困境\">01 · The problem</small></p><h2 data-en-html=\"Chat history is long. <span>Context is still invisible.</span>\" data-zh-html=\"聊天越聊越长，<span>上下文反而越来越模糊。</span>\">\n              Chat history is long. <span>Context is still invisible.</span>\n            </h2>\n            <p data-en=\"The interface shows what was said, not which history enters the next request.\" data-zh=\"界面记下了说过的话，却没告诉你：下一次，究竟哪些内容会发给模型。\">\n              The interface shows what was said, not which history enters the next request.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n        <div data-range=\"0.17 0.39\">\n            <p><small data-en=\"02 · Externalize\" data-zh=\"02 · 展开\">02 · Externalize</small></p><h2 data-en-html=\"Ask from the source. <span>Clip what matters.</span>\" data-zh-html=\"从原文直接追问，<br /><span>也把重要的摘到画布。</span>\">\n              Ask from the source. <span>Clip what matters.</span>\n            </h2>\n            <p data-en=\"Ask from a selected passage, or turn a passage or figure into its own source-linked node. Provenance stays attached; context remains yours to wire.\" data-zh=\"选中原文就能直接追问，也能把文字或图像摘成带出处的独立节点。出处会保留，是否进入上下文仍由你连线决定。\">\n              Ask from a selected passage, or turn a passage or figure into its own\n              source-linked node. Provenance stays attached; context remains yours to wire.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n        <div data-range=\"0.38 0.62\">\n            <p><small data-en=\"03 · Inspect\" data-zh=\"03 · 检查\">03 · Inspect</small></p><h2 data-en-html=\"Before sending, <span>inspect what the model will read.</span>\" data-zh-html=\"生成之前，<span>先看清模型的上下文。</span>\">\n              Before sending, <span>inspect what the model will read.</span>\n            </h2>\n            <p data-en=\"Preview source nodes, order, and token count. Context is no longer a hidden decision.\" data-zh=\"来源、顺序和 token 用量一目了然。上下文不再由系统悄悄决定。\">\n              Preview source nodes, order, and token count. Context is no longer a hidden\n              decision.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n        <div data-range=\"0.61 0.82\">\n            <p><small data-en=\"04 · Edit\" data-zh=\"04 · 编辑\">04 · Edit</small></p><h2 data-en-html=\"Delete one edge. <span>Ask the same question again.</span>\" data-zh-html=\"剪掉一条线。<br /><span>同一个问题，<br />再问一次。</span>\">\n              Delete one edge. <span>Ask the same question again.</span>\n            </h2>\n            <p data-en=\"The removed branch really leaves the request. The answer changes with the context.\" data-zh=\"这条分支会真正退出上下文；问题没变，答案会随着上下文改变。\">\n              The removed branch really leaves the request. The answer changes with the\n              context.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n        <div data-range=\"0.81 1.00\">\n            <p><small data-en=\"05 · The protocol\" data-zh=\"05 · 上下文协议\">05 · The protocol</small></p><h2 data-en-html=\"Most canvases organize information. <span>ThoughtDAG edits context.</span>\" data-zh-html=\"很多画布只是在整理信息。<span>ThoughtDAG 让你直接编辑模型的上下文。</span>\">\n              Most canvases organize information. <span>ThoughtDAG edits context.</span>\n            </h2>\n            <p data-en=\"You decide what enters and leaves. The graph is the context protocol before generation.\" data-zh=\"什么进入，什么退出，由你决定。图不是回答生成后的装饰，而是生成前的上下文协议。\">\n              You decide what enters and leaves. The graph is the context protocol before\n              generation.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n        \n        <p><strong id=\"chapter-count\">1 / 5</strong>\n          <span id=\"chapter-label\">Invisible context</span>\n        </p>\n      </div></DIV>","content_text":"ThoughtDAG Your thinking deserves a mapA wire is the context Scroll CHAT HIDES CONTEXT. THE GRAPH IS THE CONTEXT. Linear conversation Editable context graph Same prompt · different context AI conversation 87 messages Compare three research paths. Start with the first. Its advantage is… What if the core hypothesis fails? Consider another explanation… Also, what should I eat tonight? There is a new restaurant nearby. The history is here. Which parts enter the next request? research-paper.pdfp.7 Results The effect appears only in the experimental condition. Selected from the page Clipped passageresearch-paper.pdf · p.7 The effect appears only in the experimental condition Source linked · not wired yet Asked from sourceresearch-paper.pdf · p.7 What does this evidence actually mean? The source is in context Unrelated branchdetour What should I eat tonight? This history should not enter the research summary. Still connected Polluted summary 3 sources Research summary… also, consider hot pot for dinner. The prompt stayed the same. Polluted context changed the answer. Includes unrelated branch Will send1,284 tokens Preview what the model will receive Incoming ancestors: Research question Evidence A Dinner detour After deleting the orange edge: −47 tokens Context diff−47 tok The dinner detour left context Same prompt · regenerate Same promptask again Give me a bullet-point summary The words are identical. Only one edge changed. Reproducible context Clean answer 2 sources One: record the database version. Two: use independent reviewers. Three: resolve conflicts with a third reviewer. The unrelated dinner suggestion is gone. Answer updated in place One ruleThoughtDAG Wires are context. No hidden memory selector. What the model sees, why, and what was removed stay visible in the graph. Visible Editable Inspectable 01 · The problem Chat history is long. Context is still invisible. The interface shows what was said, not which history enters the next request. 02 · Externalize Ask from the source. Clip what matters. Ask from a selected passage, or turn a passage or figure into its own source-linked node. Provenance stays attached; context remains yours to wire. 03 · Inspect Before sending, inspect what the model will read. Preview source nodes, order, and token count. Context is no longer a hidden decision. 04 · Edit Delete one edge. Ask the same question again. The removed branch really leaves the request. The answer changes with the context. 05 · The protocol Most canvases organize information. ThoughtDAG edits context. You decide what enters and leaves. The graph is the context protocol before generation. 1 / 5 Invisible context","fetched_at":"2026-08-16T06:11:53.054Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<p>ThoughtDAG</p>","sentences":[{"en":"ThoughtDAG","zh":"思想DAG"}]},{"html_en":"<h2 data-zh-html=\"思考值得一张地图<br /><span>连线即上下文</span>\" data-en-html=\"Your thinking deserves a map<br /><span>A wire is the context</span>\">\n              Your thinking deserves a map<br><span>A wire is the context</span>\n            </h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Your thinking deserves a mapA wire is the context","zh":"你的想法值得一张地图一根线就是上下文"}]},{"html_en":"<p data-en=\"Scroll\" data-zh=\"向下滚动\">Scroll</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Scroll","zh":"滚动"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n            CHAT HIDES CONTEXT.\n          </p>","sentences":[{"en":"CHAT HIDES CONTEXT.","zh":"聊天隐藏了上下文。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n            THE GRAPH IS THE CONTEXT.\n          </p>","sentences":[{"en":"THE GRAPH IS THE CONTEXT.","zh":"图表就是背景。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Linear conversation\" data-zh=\"线性聊天\">Linear conversation</span>\n          </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Linear conversation","zh":"线性对话"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Editable context graph\" data-zh=\"可编辑的上下文图\">Editable context graph</span>\n          </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Editable context graph","zh":"可编辑上下文图"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Same prompt · different context\" data-zh=\"同一个问题 · 不同的上下文\">Same prompt · different context</span>\n          </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Same prompt · different context","zh":"相同的提示·不同的上下文"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"AI conversation\" data-zh=\"AI 对话\">AI conversation</span>\n              <span data-en=\"87 messages\" data-zh=\"87 条消息\">87 messages</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"AI conversation 87 messages","zh":"AI对话87条消息"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n                Compare three research paths.\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Compare three research paths.","zh":"比较三种研究路径。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n                Start with the first. Its advantage is…\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Start with the first.","zh":"从第一个开始。"},{"en":"Its advantage is…","zh":"它的优点是……"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n                What if the core hypothesis fails?\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"What if the core hypothesis fails?","zh":"如果核心假设失败怎么办？"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n                Consider another explanation…\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Consider another explanation…","zh":"考虑另一种解释……"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n                Also, what should I eat tonight?\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Also, what should I eat tonight?","zh":"还有，今晚应该吃什么？"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n                There is a new restaurant nearby.\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"There is a new restaurant nearby.","zh":"附近有一家新餐厅。"}]},{"html_en":"<p data-en=\"The history is here. Which parts enter the next request?\" data-zh=\"聊天都在这里，可下一次到底会带上哪些内容？\">\n                The history is here. Which parts enter the next request?\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"The history is here.","zh":"历史就在这里。"},{"en":"Which parts enter the next request?","zh":"哪些部分进入下一个请求？"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>research-paper.pdf</span><span>p.7</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"research-paper.pdfp.7","zh":"研究论文.pdfp.7"}]},{"html_en":"<h3 data-en=\"Results\" data-zh=\"实验结果\">Results</h3>","sentences":[{"en":"Results","zh":"结果"}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n                The effect appears only in the experimental condition.\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"The effect appears only in the experimental condition.","zh":"该效果仅在实验条件下出现。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Selected from the page\" data-zh=\"从原文中选中\">Selected from the page</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Selected from the page","zh":"从页面中选择"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Clipped passage\" data-zh=\"摘出的段落\">Clipped passage</span><span>research-paper.pdf · p.7</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Clipped passageresearch-paper.pdf · p.7","zh":"剪辑段落研究论文.pdf · p.7"}]},{"html_en":"<h3 data-en=\"The effect appears only in the experimental condition\" data-zh=\"这个效应只在实验条件下出现\">\n                The effect appears only in the experimental condition\n              </h3>","sentences":[{"en":"The effect appears only in the experimental condition","zh":"该效果仅在实验条件下出现"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Source linked · not wired yet\" data-zh=\"保留出处 · 尚未连入\">Source linked · not wired yet</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Source linked · not wired yet","zh":"来源链接·尚未连线"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Asked from source\" data-zh=\"从原文追问\">Asked from source</span><span>research-paper.pdf · p.7</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Asked from sourceresearch-paper.pdf · p.7","zh":"询问 sourceresearch-paper.pdf · p.7"}]},{"html_en":"<h3 data-en=\"What does this evidence actually mean?\" data-zh=\"这段证据究竟意味着什么？\">\n                What does this evidence actually mean?\n              </h3>","sentences":[{"en":"What does this evidence actually mean?","zh":"这个证据到底意味着什么？"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"The source is in context\" data-zh=\"原文已进入上下文\">The source is in context</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"The source is in context","zh":"来源是在上下文中"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Unrelated branch\" data-zh=\"无关分支\">Unrelated branch</span><span data-en=\"detour\" data-zh=\"岔路\">detour</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Unrelated branchdetour","zh":"不相关的分支绕行"}]},{"html_en":"<h3 data-en=\"What should I eat tonight?\" data-zh=\"今晚吃什么？\">\n                What should I eat tonight?\n              </h3>","sentences":[{"en":"What should I eat tonight?","zh":"今晚我该吃什么？"}]},{"html_en":"<p data-en=\"This history should not enter the research summary.\" data-zh=\"这段对话不该进入研究总结。\">\n                This history should not enter the research summary.\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"This history should not enter the research summary.","zh":"这段历史不应进入研究摘要。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Still connected\" data-zh=\"仍在上下文中\">Still connected</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Still connected","zh":"仍然连接"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Polluted summary\" data-zh=\"混入闲聊的总结\">Polluted summary</span>\n              <span data-en=\"3 sources\" data-zh=\"3 个来源\">3 sources</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Polluted summary 3 sources","zh":"污染摘要3个来源"}]},{"html_en":"<h3 data-en=\"Research summary… also, consider hot pot for dinner.\" data-zh=\"研究总结……另外，晚饭可以吃火锅。\">\n                Research summary… also, consider hot pot for dinner.\n              </h3>","sentences":[{"en":"Research summary…","zh":"研究总结..."},{"en":"also, consider hot pot for dinner.","zh":"另外，晚餐也可以考虑吃火锅。"}]},{"html_en":"<p data-en=\"The prompt stayed the same. Polluted context changed the answer.\" data-zh=\"问题没变，混进来的上下文却改变了答案。\">\n                The prompt stayed the same. Polluted context changed the answer.\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"The prompt stayed the same.","zh":"提示保持不变。"},{"en":"Polluted context changed the answer.","zh":"被污染的环境改变了答案。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Includes unrelated branch\" data-zh=\"混入无关分支\">Includes unrelated branch</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Includes unrelated branch","zh":"包括不相关的分支"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Will send\" data-zh=\"将发送给模型\">Will send</span><span>1,284 tokens</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Will send1,284 tokens","zh":"将发送 1,284 个代币"}]},{"html_en":"<h3 data-en=\"Preview what the model will receive\" data-zh=\"生成前，先看看模型会读到什么\">\n                Preview what the model will receive\n              </h3>","sentences":[{"en":"Preview what the model will receive","zh":"预览模型将收到的内容"}]},{"html_en":"<p data-en=\"Incoming ancestors:\" data-zh=\"这次会带上：\">\n                Incoming ancestors:\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Incoming ancestors:","zh":"传入的祖先："}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Research question\" data-zh=\"研究问题\">Research question</span>\n              <span data-en=\"Evidence A\" data-zh=\"证据 A\">Evidence A</span>\n              <span data-en=\"Dinner detour\" data-zh=\"晚饭话题\">Dinner detour</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Research question Evidence A Dinner detour","zh":"研究问题 证据 晚餐绕道"}]},{"html_en":"<p data-en=\"After deleting the orange edge: −47 tokens\" data-zh=\"删掉橙色连线后：减少 47 tokens\">\n                After deleting the orange edge: −47 tokens\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"After deleting the orange edge: −47 tokens","zh":"删除橙色边缘后：−47 个标记"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Context diff\" data-zh=\"上下文变化\">Context diff</span><span>−47 tok</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Context diff−47 tok","zh":"上下文 diff−47 tok"}]},{"html_en":"<h3 data-en=\"The dinner detour left context\" data-zh=\"晚饭话题已移出上下文\">\n                The dinner detour left context\n              </h3>","sentences":[{"en":"The dinner detour left context","zh":"晚餐绕行留下了背景"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Same prompt · regenerate\" data-zh=\"同一个问题 · 再生成一次\">Same prompt · regenerate</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Same prompt · regenerate","zh":"相同提示·重新生成"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Same prompt\" data-zh=\"同一个问题\">Same prompt</span><span data-en=\"ask again\" data-zh=\"再问一次\">ask again</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Same promptask again","zh":"同样的提示再次询问"}]},{"html_en":"<h3 data-en=\"Give me a bullet-point summary\" data-zh=\"请用要点总结\">\n                Give me a bullet-point summary\n              </h3>","sentences":[{"en":"Give me a bullet-point summary","zh":"给我一个要点总结"}]},{"html_en":"<p data-en=\"The words are identical. Only one edge changed.\" data-zh=\"问题一字未改，只有一条连线变了。\">\n                The words are identical. Only one edge changed.\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"The words are identical.","zh":"词是一模一样的。"},{"en":"Only one edge changed.","zh":"仅一侧边缘发生变化。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Reproducible context\" data-zh=\"上下文可复现\">Reproducible context</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Reproducible context","zh":"可重现的上下文"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Clean answer\" data-zh=\"更新后的回答\">Clean answer</span>\n              <span data-en=\"2 sources\" data-zh=\"2 个来源\">2 sources</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Clean answer 2 sources","zh":"干净答案 2 来源"}]},{"html_en":"<h3 data-en=\"One: record the database version. Two: use independent reviewers. Three: resolve conflicts with a third reviewer.\" data-zh=\"要点一：记录数据库版本。要点二：双人独立筛选。要点三：冲突由第三人仲裁。\">\n                One: record the database version. Two: use independent reviewers. Three:\n                resolve conflicts with a third reviewer.\n              </h3>","sentences":[{"en":"One: record the database version.","zh":"一：记录数据库版本。"},{"en":"Two: use independent reviewers.","zh":"二：使用独立审稿人。"},{"en":"Three: resolve conflicts with a third reviewer.","zh":"三：解决与第三位审稿人的冲突。"}]},{"html_en":"<p data-en=\"The unrelated dinner suggestion is gone.\" data-zh=\"回答里不再出现无关的晚饭建议。\">\n                The unrelated dinner suggestion is gone.\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"The unrelated dinner suggestion is gone.","zh":"不相关的晚餐建议消失了。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Answer updated in place\" data-zh=\"答案已更新\">Answer updated in place</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Answer updated in place","zh":"答案已就地更新"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"One rule\" data-zh=\"一条规则\">One rule</span><span>ThoughtDAG</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"One ruleThoughtDAG","zh":"一条规则ThoughtDAG"}]},{"html_en":"<h3 data-en=\"Wires are context.\" data-zh=\"连线即上下文\">\n                Wires are context.\n              </h3>","sentences":[{"en":"Wires are context.","zh":"电线是上下文。"}]},{"html_en":"<p data-en=\"No hidden memory selector. What the model sees, why, and what was removed stay visible in the graph.\" data-zh=\"不必把上下文筛选交给藏在系统里的黑盒。模型看到了什么、为什么会看到、哪些内容被删掉，图上都清清楚楚。\">\n                No hidden memory selector. What the model sees, why, and what was removed\n                stay visible in the graph.\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"No hidden memory selector.","zh":"没有隐藏的内存选择器。"},{"en":"What the model sees, why, and what was removed stay visible in the graph.","zh":"模型看到的内容、原因以及删除的内容在图表中保持可见。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span data-en=\"Visible\" data-zh=\"可见\">Visible</span>\n              <span data-en=\"Editable\" data-zh=\"可编辑\">Editable</span>\n              <span data-en=\"Inspectable\" data-zh=\"可追溯\">Inspectable</span>\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Visible Editable Inspectable","zh":"可见可编辑可检查"}]},{"html_en":"<p><small data-en=\"01 · The problem\" data-zh=\"01 · 困境\">01 · The problem</small></p>","sentences":[{"en":"01 · The problem","zh":"01 · 问题"}]},{"html_en":"<h2 data-en-html=\"Chat history is long. <span>Context is still invisible.</span>\" data-zh-html=\"聊天越聊越长，<span>上下文反而越来越模糊。</span>\">\n              Chat history is long. <span>Context is still invisible.</span>\n            </h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Chat history is long.","zh":"聊天记录很长。"},{"en":"Context is still invisible.","zh":"上下文仍然是不可见的。"}]},{"html_en":"<p data-en=\"The interface shows what was said, not which history enters the next request.\" data-zh=\"界面记下了说过的话，却没告诉你：下一次，究竟哪些内容会发给模型。\">\n              The interface shows what was said, not which history enters the next request.\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"The interface shows what was said, not which history enters the next request.","zh":"界面显示所说的内容，而不是哪个历史记录进入下一个请求。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><small data-en=\"02 · Externalize\" data-zh=\"02 · 展开\">02 · Externalize</small></p>","sentences":[{"en":"02 · Externalize","zh":"02 · 外在化"}]},{"html_en":"<h2 data-en-html=\"Ask from the source. <span>Clip what matters.</span>\" data-zh-html=\"从原文直接追问，<br /><span>也把重要的摘到画布。</span>\">\n              Ask from the source. <span>Clip what matters.</span>\n            </h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Ask from the source.","zh":"向源头询问。"},{"en":"Clip what matters.","zh":"剪辑重要的内容。"}]},{"html_en":"<p data-en=\"Ask from a selected passage, or turn a passage or figure into its own source-linked node. Provenance stays attached; context remains yours to wire.\" data-zh=\"选中原文就能直接追问，也能把文字或图像摘成带出处的独立节点。出处会保留，是否进入上下文仍由你连线决定。\">\n              Ask from a selected passage, or turn a passage or figure into its own\n              source-linked node. Provenance stays attached; context remains yours to wire.\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Ask from a selected passage, or turn a passage or figure into its own source-linked node.","zh":"从选定的段落中询问，或将段落或图形变成其自己的源链接节点。"},{"en":"Provenance stays attached; context remains yours to wire.","zh":"出处保持附着；上下文仍然由您来连接。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><small data-en=\"03 · Inspect\" data-zh=\"03 · 检查\">03 · Inspect</small></p>","sentences":[{"en":"03 · Inspect","zh":"03·检查"}]},{"html_en":"<h2 data-en-html=\"Before sending, <span>inspect what the model will read.</span>\" data-zh-html=\"生成之前，<span>先看清模型的上下文。</span>\">\n              Before sending, <span>inspect what the model will read.</span>\n            </h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Before sending, inspect what the model will read.","zh":"发送之前，检查模型将读取的内容。"}]},{"html_en":"<p data-en=\"Preview source nodes, order, and token count. Context is no longer a hidden decision.\" data-zh=\"来源、顺序和 token 用量一目了然。上下文不再由系统悄悄决定。\">\n              Preview source nodes, order, and token count. Context is no longer a hidden\n              decision.\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Preview source nodes, order, and token count.","zh":"预览源节点、顺序和令牌计数。"},{"en":"Context is no longer a hidden decision.","zh":"上下文不再是一个隐藏的决定。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><small data-en=\"04 · Edit\" data-zh=\"04 · 编辑\">04 · Edit</small></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<h2 data-en-html=\"Delete one edge. <span>Ask the same question again.</span>\" data-zh-html=\"剪掉一条线。<br /><span>同一个问题，<br />再问一次。</span>\">\n              Delete one edge. <span>Ask the same question again.</span>\n            </h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Delete one edge.","zh":"删除一条边。"},{"en":"Ask the same question again.","zh":"再问同样的问题。"}]},{"html_en":"<p data-en=\"The removed branch really leaves the request. The answer changes with the context.\" data-zh=\"这条分支会真正退出上下文；问题没变，答案会随着上下文改变。\">\n              The removed branch really leaves the request. The answer changes with the\n              context.\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"The removed branch really leaves the request.","zh":"删除的分支确实留下了请求。"},{"en":"The answer changes with the context.","zh":"答案随上下文而变化。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><small data-en=\"05 · The protocol\" data-zh=\"05 · 上下文协议\">05 · The protocol</small></p>","sentences":[{"en":"05 · The protocol","zh":"05·协议"}]},{"html_en":"<h2 data-en-html=\"Most canvases organize information. <span>ThoughtDAG edits context.</span>\" data-zh-html=\"很多画布只是在整理信息。<span>ThoughtDAG 让你直接编辑模型的上下文。</span>\">\n              Most canvases organize information. <span>ThoughtDAG edits context.</span>\n            </h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Most canvases organize information.","zh":"大多数画布都会组织信息。"},{"en":"ThoughtDAG edits context.","zh":"ThoughtDAG 编辑上下文。"}]},{"html_en":"<p data-en=\"You decide what enters and leaves. The graph is the context protocol before generation.\" data-zh=\"什么进入，什么退出，由你决定。图不是回答生成后的装饰，而是生成前的上下文协议。\">\n              You decide what enters and leaves. The graph is the context protocol before\n              generation.\n            </p>","sentences":[{"en":"You decide what enters and leaves.","zh":"您决定什么进入和离开。"},{"en":"The graph is the context protocol before generation.","zh":"该图是生成之前的上下文协议。"}]},{"html_en":"<p><strong id=\"chapter-count\">1 / 5</strong>\n          <span id=\"chapter-label\">Invisible context</span>\n        </p>","sentences":[{"en":"1 / 5 Invisible context","zh":"1 / 5 隐形上下文"}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div aria-label=\"ThoughtDAG interactive story\" id=\"story\">\n        <div id=\"story-intro\">\n            <p>思想DAG</p>\n            <h2 data-zh-html=\"思考值得一张地图<br /><span>连线即上下文</span>\" data-en-html=\"Your thinking deserves a map<br /><span>A wire is the context</span>\">你的想法值得一张地图一根线就是上下文</h2>\n            <p data-en=\"Scroll\" data-zh=\"向下滚动\">滚动</p>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"world\">\n          <p>聊天隐藏了上下文。</p>\n          <p>图表就是背景。</p>\n\n          <p>线性对话</p>\n          <p>可编辑上下文图</p>\n          <p>相同的提示·不同的上下文</p>\n\n          \n\n          \n\n          <article data-start=\"0.00\">\n            <p>AI对话87条消息</p>\n            <div>\n              <p>比较三种研究路径。</p>\n              <p>从第一个开始。 它的优点是……</p>\n              <p>如果核心假设失败怎么办？</p>\n              <p>考虑另一种解释……</p>\n              <p>还有，今晚应该吃什么？</p>\n              <p>附近有一家新餐厅。</p>\n              <p data-en=\"The history is here. Which parts enter the next request?\" data-zh=\"聊天都在这里，可下一次到底会带上哪些内容？\">历史就在这里。 哪些部分进入下一个请求？</p>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article id=\"source-pdf\" data-start=\"0.15\" data-end=\"0.39\">\n            <p>研究论文.pdfp.7</p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"Results\" data-zh=\"实验结果\">结果</h3>\n              \n              <p>该效果仅在实验条件下出现。</p>\n              <p>从页面中选择</p></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article id=\"evidence-a\" data-start=\"0.23\">\n            <p>剪辑段落研究论文.pdf · p.7</p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"The effect appears only in the experimental condition\" data-zh=\"这个效应只在实验条件下出现\">该效果仅在实验条件下出现</h3>\n              <p>来源链接·尚未连线</p></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article id=\"research-question\" data-start=\"0.26\">\n            <p>询问 sourceresearch-paper.pdf · p.7</p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"What does this evidence actually mean?\" data-zh=\"这段证据究竟意味着什么？\">这个证据到底意味着什么？</h3>\n              <p>来源是在上下文中</p></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article id=\"dinner-detour\" data-start=\"0.24\" data-end=\"0.61\">\n            <p>不相关的分支绕行</p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"What should I eat tonight?\" data-zh=\"今晚吃什么？\">今晚我该吃什么？</h3>\n              <p data-en=\"This history should not enter the research summary.\" data-zh=\"这段对话不该进入研究总结。\">这段历史不应进入研究摘要。</p>\n              <p>仍然连接</p></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article id=\"polluted-summary\" data-start=\"0.30\" data-end=\"0.61\">\n            <p>污染摘要3个来源</p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"Research summary… also, consider hot pot for dinner.\" data-zh=\"研究总结……另外，晚饭可以吃火锅。\">研究总结... 另外，晚餐也可以考虑吃火锅。</h3>\n              <p data-en=\"The prompt stayed the same. Polluted context changed the answer.\" data-zh=\"问题没变，混进来的上下文却改变了答案。\">提示保持不变。 被污染的环境改变了答案。</p>\n              <p>包括不相关的分支</p></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article data-start=\"0.39\">\n            <p>将发送 1,284 个代币</p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"Preview what the model will receive\" data-zh=\"生成前，先看看模型会读到什么\">预览模型将收到的内容</h3>\n              <p data-en=\"Incoming ancestors:\" data-zh=\"这次会带上：\">传入的祖先：</p>\n              <p>研究问题 证据 晚餐绕道</p><p data-en=\"After deleting the orange edge: −47 tokens\" data-zh=\"删掉橙色连线后：减少 47 tokens\">删除橙色边缘后：−47 个标记</p>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article id=\"context-diff\" data-start=\"0.61\">\n            <p>上下文 diff−47 tok</p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"The dinner detour left context\" data-zh=\"晚饭话题已移出上下文\">晚餐绕行留下了背景</h3>\n              <p>相同提示·重新生成</p></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article id=\"same-prompt\" data-start=\"0.67\">\n            <p>同样的提示再次询问</p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"Give me a bullet-point summary\" data-zh=\"请用要点总结\">给我一个要点总结</h3>\n              <p data-en=\"The words are identical. Only one edge changed.\" data-zh=\"问题一字未改，只有一条连线变了。\">词是一模一样的。 仅一侧边缘发生变化。</p>\n              <p>可重现的上下文</p></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article id=\"clean-answer\" data-start=\"0.75\">\n            <p>干净答案 2 来源</p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"One: record the database version. Two: use independent reviewers. Three: resolve conflicts with a third reviewer.\" data-zh=\"要点一：记录数据库版本。要点二：双人独立筛选。要点三：冲突由第三人仲裁。\">一：记录数据库版本。 二：使用独立审稿人。 三：解决与第三位审稿人的冲突。</h3>\n              <p data-en=\"The unrelated dinner suggestion is gone.\" data-zh=\"回答里不再出现无关的晚饭建议。\">不相关的晚餐建议消失了。</p>\n              <p>答案已就地更新</p></div>\n          </article>\n\n          <article data-start=\"0.84\">\n            <p>一条规则ThoughtDAG</p>\n            <div>\n              <h3 data-en=\"Wires are context.\" data-zh=\"连线即上下文\">电线是上下文。</h3>\n              <p data-en=\"No hidden memory selector. What the model sees, why, and what was removed stay visible in the graph.\" data-zh=\"不必把上下文筛选交给藏在系统里的黑盒。模型看到了什么、为什么会看到、哪些内容被删掉，图上都清清楚楚。\">没有隐藏的内存选择器。 模型看到的内容、原因以及删除的内容在图表中保持可见。</p>\n              <p>可见可编辑可检查</p></div>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n\n        \n\n        <div data-range=\"0.05 0.18\">\n            <p>01 · 问题</p><h2 data-en-html=\"Chat history is long. <span>Context is still invisible.</span>\" data-zh-html=\"聊天越聊越长，<span>上下文反而越来越模糊。</span>\">聊天记录很长。 上下文仍然是不可见的。</h2>\n            <p data-en=\"The interface shows what was said, not which history enters the next request.\" data-zh=\"界面记下了说过的话，却没告诉你：下一次，究竟哪些内容会发给模型。\">界面显示所说的内容，而不是哪个历史记录进入下一个请求。</p>\n          </div>\n\n        <div data-range=\"0.17 0.39\">\n            <p>02 · 外在化</p><h2 data-en-html=\"Ask from the source. <span>Clip what matters.</span>\" data-zh-html=\"从原文直接追问，<br /><span>也把重要的摘到画布。</span>\">向源头询问。 剪辑重要的内容。</h2>\n            <p data-en=\"Ask from a selected passage, or turn a passage or figure into its own source-linked node. Provenance stays attached; context remains yours to wire.\" data-zh=\"选中原文就能直接追问，也能把文字或图像摘成带出处的独立节点。出处会保留，是否进入上下文仍由你连线决定。\">从选定的段落中询问，或将段落或图形变成其自己的源链接节点。 出处保持附着；上下文仍然由您来连接。</p>\n          </div>\n\n        <div data-range=\"0.38 0.62\">\n            <p>03·检查</p><h2 data-en-html=\"Before sending, <span>inspect what the model will read.</span>\" data-zh-html=\"生成之前，<span>先看清模型的上下文。</span>\">发送之前，检查模型将读取的内容。</h2>\n            <p data-en=\"Preview source nodes, order, and token count. Context is no longer a hidden decision.\" data-zh=\"来源、顺序和 token 用量一目了然。上下文不再由系统悄悄决定。\">预览源节点、顺序和令牌计数。 上下文不再是一个隐藏的决定。</p>\n          </div>\n\n        <div data-range=\"0.61 0.82\">\n            <p><small data-en=\"04 · Edit\" data-zh=\"04 · 编辑\">04 · Edit</small></p><h2 data-en-html=\"Delete one edge. <span>Ask the same question again.</span>\" data-zh-html=\"剪掉一条线。<br /><span>同一个问题，<br />再问一次。</span>\">删除一条边。 再问同样的问题。</h2>\n            <p data-en=\"The removed branch really leaves the request. The answer changes with the context.\" data-zh=\"这条分支会真正退出上下文；问题没变，答案会随着上下文改变。\">删除的分支确实留下了请求。 答案随上下文而变化。</p>\n          </div>\n\n        <div data-range=\"0.81 1.00\">\n            <p>05·协议</p><h2 data-en-html=\"Most canvases organize information. <span>ThoughtDAG edits context.</span>\" data-zh-html=\"很多画布只是在整理信息。<span>ThoughtDAG 让你直接编辑模型的上下文。</span>\">大多数画布都会组织信息。 ThoughtDAG 编辑上下文。</h2>\n            <p data-en=\"You decide what enters and leaves. The graph is the context protocol before generation.\" data-zh=\"什么进入，什么退出，由你决定。图不是回答生成后的装饰，而是生成前的上下文协议。\">您决定什么进入和离开。 该图是生成之前的上下文协议。</p>\n          </div>\n\n        \n        <p>1 / 5 隐形上下文</p>\n      </div></div>"}